  "problem": "Which of the following random variables can be modeled as a discrete uniform distribution?\n\nI. The number obtained when picking an integer between $1$ and $10$ at random.\n\nII. The number obtained when picking a real number between $1$ and $10$ at random.\n\nIII. The color of the ball obtained when a ball from a bag containing $3$ blue and $4$ red balls is chosen at random.",
